      "text": "The San Diego Air and Marine Branch successfully supported the historic inaugural NASCAR race at Naval Base Coronado, San Diego, over the weekend. Air and Marine Operations teams deployed advanced A-Star and UH60 helicopters with real-time surveillance technology to provide air security and overwatch for the NASCAR Cup Series Anduril 250. On the water, AMO vessels ensured robust maritime security around the base. Their efforts helped keep race participants, fans, and military personnel safe throughout this landmark event. Great work SDAMB. #NASCAR",
